internal/oracle/testdata/record_declared_keys_refused/r02_construction.a:6:28: Adamic 0.1 refuses a write into a record with declared properties through a key that is not one literal, which can store under a declared property what it does not hold (Options written by name: outFile is declared string | undefined, and the index signature holds string | number | undefined); give the record no declared keys, or write the declared property by its name
